{
  "edge_lattices/edge_lattices_provenance.md": "edge_lattices/edge_lattices_provenance.txt",
  "note": "Partial human reconstruction of RH and Dirichlet GRH. This increment supplies actual full-range Mt forms on a compatible supplied geometric state, original-DVR good lattices and Hecke signatures, and the literal initial SideB endpoint with its zero theta/empty toric initialization and supplied NTh exposed. It proves four supported local primitives. It proves the quantitative moved-vacuum dictionary with exponent [F:Q]ab and one common scalar unit. It constructs the large-gap discrete series used later and calibrates formal degree using the named Harish-Chandra theorem, giving a restricted RealTied join. It proves PrimesRel and full simultaneous PairEx using the explicitly named quadratic class-number formula, Bombieri log-free density/exception refinement, and Heath-Brown density theorem; compatible supplied hosts satisfy RealBox/ThinH, while winPairs retains VWinAt. Genuine same-object theta/local installation, critical toric ratios and original-choice joins, the remaining full Core, named classical inputs and independent global/cohomological/spectral branches remain. This is not a complete self-contained RH/Dirichlet-GRH proof, full Lean build or independent kernel replay. Nineteen v0.21 root files are preserved under history/version_0_21/. The last rendered PDF remains in history/version_0_13/. Current v0.22 locations use section labels and claim IDs; no current page numbers are asserted.",
